EXCEPTION: audio file

The file `src/renderer/assets/rostov.mp3` is NOT covered by the MIT license above
and is not part of the "Software" as defined therein.

It is a recording of the traditional Russian Cossack folk song "Kak pod Rostovom-na-
Donu". The underlying work (lyrics and melody) is folk art with no known individual
copyright holder. The project authors claim no rights to this particular recording
and grant no MIT license to it; it is included as-is for user interface purposes.

Anyone using, copying or redistributing this file does so at their own risk and is
solely responsible for clearing any performers' and phonogram producers' rights.
